TITLE Pure water at 150C equilibrated with fixed-pressure gas phase (CH4-CO2-NH3)
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 150
    CH4(g)  0.4  10
    CO2(g)  0.4  10
    NH3(g)  0.2  5

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true

USER_PUNCH
    -headings Specific_conductance_uS_cm
    10 PUNCH SC
END
